title: "Spectral Green functions for T-duality-regularized electrostatics in finite and bounded planar geometries: codes and data"
abstract: >-
  Codes and data for the spectral Green functions of T-duality-regularized
  electrostatics on the square torus, the grounded half-plane and the grounded
  strip, together with the running interaction dimension on the square torus.
